{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016r4uTZges1WxZKogNgi5vT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claims 需要 scope 收窄但核心 framing 保留。Claim 1 调整为条件式检测能力声明——大 benchmark + 中高污染有效，\n  minimal-info 代价可量化。Claim 2 保留 inverted-U 但增加 boundary condition。Claim 3 缩小 audit 规模，\n  Gemini-1.5 作为 converging evidence。论文定位从 practical detector 转向 principled framework with\n  characterized operating envelope。Power-information tradeoff 的量化本身成为贡献。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Extended Simulation — High Contamination & Inverted-U Characterization\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extended-sim\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 Phase A 模拟至 60%/75%/90%/100% contamination，修复 100% boundary 处理，\n      刻画 inverted-U 拐点位置，计算 two-sided power curves。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU (14042 items)\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.979          # 复现已有结果\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.68            # 信号开始衰减——高污染 examinee 与高 ability 难分\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_75pct: 0.22            # 负向检测几乎失败\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_90pct: 0.04            # 接近零\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_60pct: 0.12            # 正向信号刚开始出现\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_75pct: 0.41            # 过度一致性可测但不强\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.73            # 正向检测可用\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_100pct: 0.88           # θ=4.0 boundary 下 lz* 显著为正\n      mmlu_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15        # 负向 power 峰值在 ~15%\n      mmlu_crossover_point: 0.58               # 正/负 power 交叉点\n      # HellaSwag (10042 items)\n      hellaswag_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.733\n      hellaswag_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.52\n      hellaswag_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.61\n      hellaswag_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15\n      # GSM8K (1319 items)\n      gsm8k_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.578\n      gsm8k_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.38\n      gsm8k_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.42\n      # ARC-C (1172 items)\n      arc_c_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.129\n      arc_c_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.31\n      # HumanEval (164 items)\n      humaneval_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.243\n      humaneval_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.18\n      # Inverted-U fit\n      inverted_u_r2_mmlu: 0.88\n      inverted_u_r2_hellaswag: 0.84\n      inverted_u_r2_gsm8k: 0.79\n      inverted_u_r2_arc_c: 0.76\n      inverted_u_r2_humaneval: 0.72\n      inverted_u_mean_r2: 0.80\n      # Two-sided combined power (max of pos/neg at each level)\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_15pct: 0.979\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_50pct: 0.68\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_75pct: 0.41\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_90pct: 0.73\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_100pct: 0.88\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 inverted-U 结构清晰存在但 transition zone (40%-70%) 出现 detection gap——\n      负向信号衰减但正向信号尚未建立，形成 ~30pp 的 power trough。这是因为中度污染同时\n      提升了 ability estimate θ（减少 aberrance）又未达到完全一致（lz*>>0 需要几乎所有 item \n      都被预知）。MMLU 因 n=14K items 保持全程最强检测力，inverted-U R² 接近 0.9；\n      小 benchmark（ARC-C, HumanEval）因 lz* 方差大，inverted-U 拟合噪声更多，R² 降至 0.72-0.76。\n      100% contamination 在 θ=4.0 boundary 处理后可计算，lz* 显著为正但受 boundary 效应影响\n      不如理论预期极端。整体 inverted-U mean R² = 0.80 落在 tier 指标范围 [0.75, 0.90] 中段。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Two-Sided Power Matrix (Simulation)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, \"power@5%\", \"power@15%\", \"power@50%\", \"power@75%\", \"power@90%\", \"power@100%\", peak_contam, crossover]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.31, 0.98, 0.68, 0.41, 0.73, 0.88, \"15%\", \"58%\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.22, 0.73, 0.52, 0.33, 0.61, 0.78, \"15%\", \"55%\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.11, 0.58, 0.38, 0.24, 0.42, 0.51, \"10-15%\", \"52%\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.05, 0.13, 0.18, 0.14, 0.31, 0.39, \"25-50%\", \"65%\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.04, 0.24, 0.15, 0.09, 0.18, 0.22, \"15%\", \"N/A\"]\n        note: \"Power = max(P(lz*<-1.96), P(lz*>+1.96)) at each contamination level. Two-sided combined.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Inverted-U Curve Parameters\"\n        columns: [benchmark, peak_neg_power, trough_power, trough_contam_range, recovery_power_at_100pct, R2_fit]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.979, 0.41, \"70-80%\", 0.88, 0.88]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.733, 0.33, \"65-80%\", 0.78, 0.84]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.578, 0.24, \"60-80%\", 0.51, 0.79]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.129, 0.13, \"15-50%\", 0.39, 0.76]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.243, 0.09, \"60-85%\", 0.22, 0.72]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Inverted-U power curves per benchmark (x=contamination%, y=detection power), showing negative-side (blue, dashed) and positive-side (red, dashed) power separately, plus two-sided envelope (black, solid). Shaded gray band marks the detection trough zone. MMLU curve clearly U-shaped; HumanEval curve nearly flat with wide confidence bands.\"\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of detection power (contamination level × benchmark), color-coded green (>0.8) / yellow (0.5-0.8) / red (<0.5). Clear diagonal pattern: large benchmarks green at moderate contamination, small benchmarks mostly red/yellow throughout.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Inverted-U 在 MMLU 和 HellaSwag 上结构清晰——峰值在 15% 左右，trough 在 70-80%，\n      100% 恢复至 0.78-0.88。但小 benchmark 的 inverted-U 更像一条低矮的丘陵而非清晰的 U 型。\n      这为 Claim 2 提供支持但需要加 boundary condition：inverted-U 的理论形状成立，\n      但只有 n_items ≥ 5K 时 peak power 才超过 0.7，使检测具有实际意义。\n      Detection trough（40-70%）是一个必须在论文中诚实报告的盲区。\n\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot — Go/No-Go\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz* 是否显著。\n      论文 go/no-go 决策点。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baseline (0% contamination, clean model)\n      qwen_clean_mmlu_accuracy: 0.71\n      qwen_clean_mmlu_theta: 1.05\n      qwen_clean_mmlu_lz_star: 18.5\n      # 15% contamination\n      qwen_15pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.78\n      qwen_15pct_mmlu_theta: 1.42\n      qwen_15pct_mmlu_lz_star: 23.8\n      qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n      qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star_cohen_d: 1.2\n      qwen_15pct_delta_accuracy: 0.07\n      # 50% contamination\n      qwen_50pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.89\n      qwen_50pct_mmlu_theta: 2.31\n      qwen_50pct_mmlu_lz_star: 14.2\n      qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star: -4.3\n      qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star_direction: \"decreased (toward normal or positive)\"\n      qwen_50pct_delta_accuracy: 0.18\n      # Statistical tests\n      ttest_clean_vs_15pct_p: 0.028\n      ttest_clean_vs_50pct_p: 0.11\n      bootstrap_ci_delta_15pct: [1.8, 8.9]\n      bootstrap_ci_delta_50pct: [-9.1, 0.5]\n      # Go/no-go\n      go_signal: \"CONDITIONAL GO\"\n      go_signal_detail: \"Δlz* significant at 15% but inverted-U already visible at 50%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：SFT 注入后 Δlz* 存在但效应量中等。Clean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上\n      已经有高 lz*（~18.5），因为所有 LLM 都违反 IRT 假设（Phase B 已证实 universal misfit）。\n      15% SFT 污染在 14K-item MMLU 上产生足够多的 aberrant responses——模型在本不该答对的\n      hard items（低 θ 区域）上答对，lz* 进一步偏离，Cohen's d ~1.2 可检测。但 50% 污染\n      触发 inverted-U 效应：大量 item 被记忆后 θ 估计大幅上升（1.05→2.31），模型看起来\n      像一个\"真正高能力\"的 examinee，aberrance pattern 被 smoothed——lz* 反而回落甚至\n      可能低于 baseline。SFT 泛化效应（domain 内未直接训练 items 的准确率也提升）进一步\n      稀释了 aberrance 信号。这给出 conditional go：15% 有信号，但 50% 的 inverted-U 效应\n      意味着高污染检测需要依赖正向 lz* 阈值，而 50% 可能恰好落在 trough zone。\n      P 值在 15% 边缘显著（0.028），50% 不显著（0.11）——因为 Δ 方向反转且 variance 大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pilot Results — Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU\"\n        columns: [condition, accuracy, theta, lz_star, delta_lz_star, cohen_d, p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (clean)\", 0.71, 1.05, 18.5, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"15%\", 0.78, 1.42, 23.8, +5.3, 1.2, 0.028]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.89, 2.31, 14.2, -4.3, 0.9, 0.11]\n        note: \"lz* computed with benchmark-specific θ and bootstrap (n=1000). Cohen's d = |Δlz*| / pooled_sd across 3 random seeds.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart with 3 conditions (clean/15%/50%), y-axis = lz*, error bars = bootstrap 95% CI. Shows non-monotonic pattern: lz* rises at 15% then drops at 50%, illustrating inverted-U in real SFT data.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot of per-subject accuracy delta (y) vs per-subject lz* delta (x) at 15% contamination. Shows that subjects with largest accuracy gains also have largest lz* increase — contamination signal is concentrated in directly trained domains.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 给出 conditional go。15% 的 Δlz* = +5.3 (Cohen's d = 1.2) 在 MMLU 上显著，\n      证明 SFT 污染可被 person-fit 检测。但 50% 的信号反转确认了 inverted-U 在真实 SFT 数据中\n      存在，且 trough 比模拟更早出现（模拟中 trough 在 70-80%，实际 50% 已开始回落），\n      可能因为 SFT 泛化效应（domain-level accuracy boost）提前了 θ 上升。\n      Go/no-go 判定：GO，但需要在完整实验中加入 25% 污染水平以精确定位 real-data inverted-U peak。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B × 6 contamination levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%) × 5 benchmarks。\n      建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 完整映射。\n    expected_results:\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, MMLU (14042 items) ===\n      qwen_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 18.5\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_lz_star: 19.8\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_delta: 1.3\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_cohen_d: 0.3\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.58\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_lz_star: 21.6\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_delta: 3.1\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_cohen_d: 0.7\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_auroc: 0.68\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_lz_star: 23.8\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_delta: 5.3\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 1.2\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.79\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_lz_star: 22.1\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_delta: 3.6\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_auroc: 0.72\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_lz_star: 14.2\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_delta: -4.3\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_auroc: 0.64\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, HellaSwag (10042 items) ===\n      qwen_hellaswag_clean_lz_star: 15.2\n      qwen_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.8\n      qwen_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n      qwen_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.74\n      qwen_hellaswag_5pct_auroc: 0.55\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, GSM8K (1319 items) ===\n      qwen_gsm8k_clean_lz_star: 6.1\n      qwen_gsm8k_15pct_delta: 1.9\n      qwen_gsm8k_15pct_cohen_d: 0.6\n      qwen_gsm8k_15pct_auroc: 0.63\n      qwen_gsm8k_5pct_auroc: 0.52\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, ARC-C (1172 items) ===\n      qwen_arcc_clean_lz_star: 4.8\n      qwen_arcc_15pct_delta: 1.1\n      qwen_arcc_15pct_cohen_d: 0.4\n      qwen_arcc_15pct_auroc: 0.58\n      qwen_arcc_5pct_auroc: 0.51\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, HumanEval (164 items) ===\n      qwen_humaneval_clean_lz_star: 2.3\n      qwen_humaneval_15pct_delta: 0.6\n      qwen_humaneval_15pct_cohen_d: 0.2\n      qwen_humaneval_15pct_auroc: 0.54\n      # === Gemma-4-31B, MMLU ===\n      gemma_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 22.1\n      gemma_mmlu_15pct_delta: 4.1\n      gemma_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 0.95\n      gemma_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.76\n      gemma_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.56\n      # === Gemma-4-31B, HellaSwag ===\n      gemma_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.2\n      gemma_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n      gemma_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.71\n      # === Cross-model consistency ===\n      cross_model_delta_direction_agreement_15pct: \"5/5 benchmarks same direction\"\n      cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_mmlu: 1.29\n      cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_hellaswag: 1.19\n      cross_model_spearman_delta_across_benchmarks: 0.70\n      # === SFT generalization effect ===\n      sft_generalization_domain_accuracy_boost: 0.03\n      sft_generalization_nontrained_item_accuracy_delta: 0.02\n      # === Summary thresholds ===\n      n_conditions_auroc_above_0.7: \"4/12 (MMLU×2models + HellaSwag×2models at 15%)\"\n      n_conditions_auroc_above_0.8: \"0/12\"\n      overall_detection_threshold: \"≥15% contamination AND ≥5K items\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档的核心预测：Cohen's d 在 0.8-2.0 之间，仅 ≥15% + ≥5K items 可靠分离。\n      \n      5% 污染检测力不足（AUROC < 0.70）——因为 5% 对应 MMLU 仅 ~700 items 被记忆，\n      产生的 aberrant pattern 在 14K-item 的 lz* 计算中被 noise 淹没。SFT 泛化效应\n      使未直接训练的同 domain items 也提升了 ~2-3pp 准确率，进一步稀释信号。\n      \n      15% 是 sweet spot——~2100 items 产生足够 aberrance，且 θ 尚未被推高到 \n      identifiability collapse 区域。但即使在 MMLU 上 AUROC 也只有 0.79 而非 0.95+，\n      因为 baseline lz* 已经很高（~18.5），Δlz* = 5.3 相对于 baseline variance 只是中等效应。\n      \n      25% 开始出现 inverted-U 衰减——θ 上升使部分 hard items 变得\"合理答对\"，\n      aberrance 减少。50% 信号反转。\n      \n      小 benchmark（ARC-C 1172 items, HumanEval 164 items）在所有污染水平下\n      都无法可靠检测——lz* 的 sampling variance 与 n_items^(-1/2) 成正比，\n      164 items 的 SE 比 14K items 大 ~9 倍。\n      \n      跨模型方向一致（两个模型在 5/5 benchmarks 上 Δlz* 同向），但幅度差异\n      20-30%——Gemma-4-31B baseline 更强（θ 更高），留给污染信号的\"空间\"更小。\n      这符合 tier 预测的\"方向一致但幅度差异大\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC by Contamination Level × Benchmark (Qwen3.5-9B)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, \"AUROC@5%\", \"AUROC@10%\", \"AUROC@15%\", \"AUROC@25%\", \"AUROC@50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.58, 0.68, 0.79, 0.72, 0.64]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.55, 0.63, 0.74, 0.68, 0.59]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.52, 0.57, 0.63, 0.60, 0.55]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.51, 0.54, 0.58, 0.56, 0.53]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.50, 0.52, 0.54, 0.53, 0.51]\n        note: \"AUROC computed over 3 seeds per condition. Chance = 0.50.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Cohen's d at 15% Contamination — Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [benchmark, qwen_d, gemma_d, direction_agree, magnitude_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 1.2, 0.95, \"yes\", 1.26]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.9, 0.8, \"yes\", 1.13]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.6, 0.5, \"yes\", 1.20]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.4, 0.3, \"yes\", 1.33]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.2, 0.15, \"yes\", 1.33]\n      - name: \"Table: SFT Generalization Analysis (Qwen3.5-9B, MMLU, 15%)\"\n        columns: [item_category, n_items, accuracy_clean, accuracy_contam, delta_acc, delta_lz_star_contribution]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Directly trained items\", 2106, 0.65, 0.94, +0.29, \"dominant signal source\"]\n          - [\"Same-domain untrained\", 4200, 0.70, 0.73, +0.03, \"noise / dilution\"]\n          - [\"Other-domain items\", 7736, 0.73, 0.74, +0.01, \"negligible\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Δlz* dose-response curves for both models × MMLU. X-axis = contamination level, Y-axis = Δlz* from clean baseline. Inverted-U clearly visible: peak at 15-25%, crossing zero around 40-50%. Qwen curve consistently above Gemma by ~1-2 lz* units. Error bars (3 seeds) overlap at 5% and 50% but separate at 15%.\"\n      - \"Fig: AUROC heatmap (contamination level × benchmark × model). 2×5×5 grid. Only the top-left quadrant (≥15% × ≥5K items) is green (>0.70). Strong diagonal gradient from top-left to bottom-right.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-item analysis at 15% contamination — scatter of item difficulty (b parameter) vs P(correct|contaminated) - P(correct|clean). Directly trained items cluster in high-difficulty, high-delta region. SFT generalization items show small diffuse delta.\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：IRT-FIT 在 controlled contamination 下给出 medium-effect detection，\n      operating envelope 为 ≥15% contamination + ≥5K items + negative-lz* regime。\n      这不是一个 practical detector（AUROC 未超过 0.80），但成功量化了 minimal-information \n      的代价——同样 ground-truth 数据上 ConStat 预期 AUROC 0.85-0.95（需 exp-baseline-comparison 确认）。\n      SFT 泛化效应是信号衰减的主要原因之一——约 3pp 的 domain-level accuracy boost \n      让 ~30% 的非训练 items 也被答对，稀释了 aberrance pattern。\n      论文需要诚实报告 operating envelope 并将 power-information tradeoff 作为核心贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Theoretical Power Derivation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-power-theory\"\n    description: >\n      基于 Snijders (2001) lz* 方差公式推导 power ∝ f(n_items, contam_rate) 的解析关系，\n      验证理论曲线与模拟的拟合度，建立 inverted-U 的理论基础。\n    expected_results:\n      # Theoretical power formula fit to simulation\n      theory_vs_sim_r2_negative_regime: 0.91\n      theory_vs_sim_r2_positive_regime: 0.83\n      theory_vs_sim_r2_combined: 0.85\n      # Derived thresholds\n      min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_15pct: 8200\n      min_n_items_for_power_0.5_at_15pct: 2800\n      min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_5pct: \">50000 (extrapolated)\"\n      # Inverted-U theoretical parameters\n      inverted_u_peak_formula: \"contam_peak ≈ σ²(θ) / (2 × E[I(θ)]) — depends on ability variance and test information\"\n      inverted_u_peak_predicted_mmlu: 0.17\n      inverted_u_peak_observed_mmlu: 0.15\n      inverted_u_trough_depth_formula: \"proportional to n_items^(-1/2) × contam_rate × (1 - contam_rate)\"\n      # Key theoretical insight\n      power_scaling: \"Power ∝ sqrt(n_items) × contam_rate × g(θ_shift) where g is a non-monotone function capturing the inverted-U\"\n      identifiability_collapse_threshold: \"contam_rate at which E[θ_contam] > θ_max_discriminating ≈ 3.0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Snijders (2001) 给出 Var(lz*) ≈ 1 + O(1/n) 在零假设下。污染注入等价于\n      向 response vector 添加 n×c 个\"能力不匹配\"的正确回答（c = contamination rate）。\n      \n      在负向 regime（低-中污染），lz* 的期望偏移 ∝ sqrt(n) × c × Σ[log P_j(θ) 的 aberrance term]，\n      power 随 sqrt(n) 增长——这解释了为什么 MMLU (14K) 的 power 远超 ARC-C (1172)。\n      理论与模拟在负向 regime 拟合良好（R² = 0.91），因为 Snijders 的正态近似在\n      大 n 下准确。\n      \n      正向 regime 拟合较差（R² = 0.83）因为 identifiability collapse 涉及 θ 估计的\n      boundary 效应——当 θ → ∞ 时 MLE 不稳定，理论公式的渐近近似失效。\n      这也是 median 档的体现：理论框架基本成立但在边界条件下精度降低。\n      \n      min_n_items 阈值计算表明 5% 污染在任何现有 benchmark 上都不可检测\n      （需 >50K items），支持 \"scope 收窄\" 的叙事——IRT-FIT 不是万能探测器，\n      它在特定 operating envelope 内工作。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Theoretical vs Simulated Power\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, sim_power_15pct, theory_power_15pct, residual, sim_power_5pct, theory_power_5pct, residual_5pct]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.979, 0.96, +0.019, 0.31, 0.28, +0.03]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.733, 0.75, -0.017, 0.22, 0.20, +0.02]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.578, 0.54, +0.038, 0.11, 0.10, +0.01]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.129, 0.15, -0.021, 0.05, 0.06, -0.01]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.243, 0.21, +0.033, 0.04, 0.04, 0.00]\n        note: \"ARC-C 偏差大因为 item parameters 分布偏离理论假设（难度集中在窄范围）\"\n      - name: \"Table: Minimum n_items for Target Power\"\n        columns: [target_power, contam_5pct, contam_10pct, contam_15pct, contam_25pct]\n        rows:\n          - [0.50, \">50K\", 12000, 2800, 900]\n          - [0.80, \">50K\", 25000, 8200, 2200]\n          - [0.90, \">50K\", 40000, 12500, 3500]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power surface — 3D plot with axes (n_items, contamination_rate, power). Theoretical surface in translucent blue, simulation data points as red dots. Good agreement in the low-contamination quadrant, visible divergence at high-contamination + small-n corner.\"\n      - \"Fig: Inverted-U decomposition — theoretical curves showing negative-lz* contribution (monotone decreasing in contam_rate) and positive-lz* contribution (monotone increasing), with their sum producing the U shape. Annotated with the peak location formula.\"\n    analysis: >\n      理论推导成功建立了 power-n_items-contamination 的解析关系，inverted-U 从经验观察\n      升级为可推导的理论命题。关键贡献是 minimum n_items 表格——这给审稿人和用户一个\n      直接可用的查询工具。理论与模拟的 combined R² = 0.85 表明理论框架基本正确，\n      但需要承认在 identifiability collapse 附近的近似误差。\n      这是论文的一个坚实理论贡献，即使检测力本身是 medium。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Data Reconnaissance\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-data-recon\"\n    description: >\n      调研 HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 per-item binary response data 可用性、格式、覆盖范围。\n    expected_results:\n      hf_results_repo_exists: true\n      per_item_binary_logs_available: \"partial\"\n      format: \"JSON with per-example predictions, not standardized across all models\"\n      n_models_total_in_leaderboard: 7000+\n      n_models_with_per_item_data: 280\n      n_models_with_complete_5benchmark_data: 150\n      benchmarks_covered: [\"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"ARC-C\", \"TruthfulQA\", \"Winogrande\", \"GSM8K\"]\n      data_format_issues: \"variable JSON schema across submission dates; some models only have aggregate scores; harness version differences (lm-eval v0.3 vs v0.4)\"\n      estimated_gpu_hours_to_supplement: 120\n      recommendation: \"proceed with 150-280 available models; supplement top-50 missing flagships via inference\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1（2023-2024 运行）使用 lm-evaluation-harness，\n      其结果存储在 open-llm-leaderboard-old/results repo 中。该 repo 包含 per-model \n      结果目录，但格式不统一——早期提交只有 aggregate JSON，后期版本包含 per-example logs。\n      \n      Median 档预测 100-500 models 有 per-item data。实际可能约 280 个模型有可用的\n      per-item 级别数据，因为 lm-eval-harness 在某个版本后开始默认保存 per-example \n      predictions，但不是所有提交者都上传了完整日志。150 个模型有完整 5-benchmark 数据，\n      足够进行 IRT 参数估计和 person-fit 计算。\n      \n      这是 median 档的典型场景——数据部分可用，需要工程投入去解析不统一的格式，\n      但不需要从零开始跑推理。280 个模型比 Phase B 的 12 个大 23 倍，\n      足以支撑 Claim 3 的 leaderboard audit，但无法声称是\"全面扫描\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Data Availability Summary\"\n        columns: [category, count, pct_of_total, notes]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total models on leaderboard\", 7200, \"100%\", \"\"]\n          - [\"Models with any results JSON\", 5800, \"80.6%\", \"some only aggregate\"]\n          - [\"Models with per-item predictions\", 280, \"3.9%\", \"lm-eval ≥v0.4\"]\n          - [\"Models with complete 5-bench per-item\", 150, \"2.1%\", \"usable for IRT-FIT\"]\n          - [\"Top-50 flagships missing per-item\", 38, \"—\", \"would need inference runs\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Timeline of per-item data availability on leaderboard — x-axis = submission date, y-axis = cumulative models with per-item data. Sharp uptick after lm-eval v0.4 release, plateau when leaderboard v1 closed.\"\n    analysis: >\n      280 models with per-item data 落在 tier 预测的 [100, 500] 范围内。\n      足够支撑 leaderboard audit 但需要在论文中明确说明覆盖率限制。\n      建议策略：用 280 个可用模型做主分析，补充 top-50 缺失的旗舰模型（约 38 个需推理），\n      总计 ~320 个模型。GPU 补充预算 ~20 hrs（38 models × ~0.5 hr each）可控。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit — Large-Scale Person-Fit Scan\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      对 ~280+ 可用模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit，绘制污染率趋势，\n      识别系统性异常模型。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_analyzed: 310\n      n_benchmarks: 5\n      total_model_benchmark_cells: 1550\n      # Flagging results (relative to controlled-contamination calibrated thresholds)\n      flagged_rate_mmlu_delta_method: 0.22\n      flagged_rate_hellaswag_delta_method: 0.18\n      flagged_rate_gsm8k_delta_method: 0.28\n      flagged_rate_arcc_delta_method: 0.15\n      flagged_rate_humaneval_delta_method: 0.12\n      overall_flagged_rate: 0.19\n      # Notable findings\n      n_models_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 18\n      n_models_flagged_all_5: 3\n      top_flagged_model_1: \"Gemini-1.5-Pro (4/5 benchmarks, highest Δlz* on MMLU)\"\n      top_flagged_model_2: \"model_family_X (multiple sizes all flagged — systematic)\"\n      top_flagged_model_3: \"model_Y (GSM8K + MATH specialist, extreme negative lz* on math benchmarks)\"\n      # Temporal trend\n      flagged_rate_2023h1: 0.12\n      flagged_rate_2023h2: 0.18\n      flagged_rate_2024h1: 0.25\n      temporal_trend_significant: true\n      temporal_trend_spearman: 0.38\n      # Cross-benchmark correlation (group level)\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_hellaswag: 0.31\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_gsm8k: 0.22\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_mean: 0.35\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_n_significant: \"3/10 pairs\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 leaderboard_flagged_rate_relative 在 [0.1, 0.4]，cross_benchmark_spearman \n      在 [0.3, 0.6]。\n      \n      Overall flagged rate ~19% 反映了两个因素的叠加：(1) 确实存在的 benchmark gaming——\n      开源社区中\"benchmark hacking\"是公开的秘密，部分模型在 MMLU/GSM8K 训练集上做过 SFT；\n      (2) Δlz* calibration 的不完美——controlled experiment 建立的阈值基于 2 个模型，\n      可能对其他架构/训练策略不够 robust，产生一定 false positives。\n      \n      时间趋势（12%→25%）有真实基础：2023 下半年到 2024 年，leaderboard 竞争加剧，\n      更多模型被发现在 benchmark data 上训练。但趋势的 effect size 中等（Spearman 0.38），\n      因为早期模型中也有污染（只是比例低）且后期有些模型反而更注意避免。\n      \n      Cross-benchmark 相关性弱到中等（mean 0.35）——这是 median 档的关键特征。\n      如果污染是系统性的（同一训练流程污染所有 benchmark），相关性应该高；\n      但实际上很多模型只在特定 benchmark 上有异常（如只刷 GSM8K 或只刷 MMLU），\n      导致 per-benchmark 信号不一致。3/10 pairs 显著优于 Phase B 的 1/10，\n      但仍然不足以支撑\"全面跨 benchmark 一致性\"的强声明。\n      \n      18 个模型在 3+ benchmarks 被标记——这些是最可信的 converging evidence cases，\n      论文应聚焦于这些而非整体 flagged rate。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Leaderboard Flagged Rate by Benchmark\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, n_models, flagged_count, flagged_rate, median_delta_lz_star_flagged, \"95%CI_flagged_rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 310, 68, 0.22, 4.8, \"[0.17, 0.27]\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 310, 56, 0.18, 3.5, \"[0.14, 0.23]\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 310, 87, 0.28, 2.1, \"[0.23, 0.33]\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 310, 47, 0.15, 1.4, \"[0.11, 0.20]\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 310, 37, 0.12, 0.8, \"[0.08, 0.16]\"]\n        note: \"Flagging based on Δlz* > threshold calibrated from exp-ctrl-contam (15% contamination boundary). GSM8K high rate may reflect both real contamination AND low-n-items false positives.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagged Models\"\n        columns: [n_benchmarks_flagged, n_models, example_models]\n        rows:\n          - [5, 3, \"Gemini-1.5-Pro, model_A, model_B\"]\n          - [4, 7, \"model_C, model_D, ...\"]\n          - [3, 8, \"model_E, model_F, ...\"]\n          - [2, 23, \"—\"]\n          - [1, 18, \"—\"]\n          - [0, 251, \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Temporal Contamination Trend\"\n        columns: [period, n_models, flagged_any, flagged_rate, \"flagged_≥3_bench\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2023 H1\", 85, 10, 0.12, 1]\n          - [\"2023 H2\", 120, 22, 0.18, 5]\n          - [\"2024 H1\", 105, 26, 0.25, 12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Leaderboard contamination landscape — scatter of models by (x=mean_accuracy, y=mean_delta_lz_star), color-coded by number of benchmarks flagged (0=gray, 1=yellow, 2=orange, 3+=red). High-accuracy + high-Δlz* quadrant contains the most suspicious models. Gemini-1.5 is an obvious outlier.\"\n      - \"Fig: Temporal trend — stacked bar chart by submission half-year, showing flagged (red) vs clean (gray) models. Increasing red proportion over time.\"\n      - \"Fig: Cross-benchmark Δlz* correlation matrix (10 pairs), with significant correlations highlighted. Mostly weak (0.2-0.4) with 3 significant pairs.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 给出 median-range 结果：19% overall flagged rate，时间趋势存在但中等，\n      cross-benchmark 一致性弱。论文应采用保守叙事策略：聚焦于 18 个 multi-benchmark flagged \n      模型作为 high-confidence cases，报告整体 flagged rate 作为 upper bound estimate，\n      明确说明 false positive rate 由 controlled experiment calibration 的 transferability 限制。\n      Gemini-1.5 case study 从\"定义性证据\"降级为\"与 leaderboard-wide pattern 一致的 converging evidence\"。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) vs 3PL (d=1 fixed) 下 detection sensitivity 差异。\n    expected_results:\n      # Simulation comparison\n      sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.979\n      sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.952\n      sim_power_delta_mmlu: -0.027\n      sim_power_4pl_arcc_15pct: 0.129\n      sim_power_3pl_arcc_15pct: 0.108\n      sim_power_delta_arcc: -0.021\n      # False alarm comparison\n      sim_fpr_4pl_alpha005: 0.048\n      sim_fpr_3pl_alpha005: 0.062\n      # Effect on real data\n      real_data_flagged_4pl: 57\n      real_data_flagged_3pl: 54\n      real_data_agreement: \"52/60 cells agree\"\n      # d parameter analysis\n      mean_d_across_benchmarks: 0.92\n      pct_items_d_lt_0.9: 0.31\n      d_impact_on_lz_star_correlation: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL 的 feasibility parameter d < 1 表示即使完全掌握 item 也无法保证答对\n      （如题目表述模糊或 label 有误）。当 d 接近 1 时 4PL ≈ 3PL。\n      \n      PSN-IRT 估计的平均 d = 0.92，说明大多数 items d 接近 1，\n      但有 ~31% 的 items d < 0.9（可能是有噪声的标注）。\n      \n      在 median 档下，d 参数的影响是可测但不大的：\n      - 4PL 的 lz* 对 high-ability examinees 更宽容（因为 d<1 意味着满分不太可能），\n        这略微提高了检测灵敏度（~2-3pp power improvement）。\n      - 在 false alarm 控制上 4PL 更好（0.048 vs 0.062），因为 3PL 在 d<1 items 上\n        会过度惩罚\"答错高概率题目\"的 pattern。\n      - 但整体差异不大：4PL vs 3PL 的 lz* 相关性 0.97，flagging 一致率 87%。\n      \n      这个 ablation 的贡献是 confirming rather than surprising——4PL 略优但 3PL 也可用，\n      意味着方法对 item parameter 选择不过度敏感。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power (Simulation)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, \"power_4PL@15%\", \"power_3PL@15%\", delta, \"FPR_4PL\", \"FPR_3PL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.979, 0.952, -0.027, 0.048, 0.062]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.733, 0.711, -0.022, 0.045, 0.058]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.578, 0.559, -0.019, 0.051, 0.065]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.129, 0.108, -0.021, 0.049, 0.067]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.243, 0.228, -0.015, 0.052, 0.061]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter of lz*_4PL vs lz*_3PL across all (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect linear relationship (r=0.97) with slight divergence at extremes. Color-coded by mean item d parameter of benchmark.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL 提供一致但微小的改进（~2-3pp power, ~1.5pp FPR reduction）。\n      足以证明 d 参数有理论和实证价值，但不是方法的核心驱动因素。\n      论文建议：主实验用 4PL，附录报告 3PL 结果作为 robustness check。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison — IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在 controlled contamination ground-truth 上比较 IRT-FIT、ConStat、Min-K%++ 的检测能力，\n      量化 minimal-information 的代价。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU at 15% contamination (primary comparison point)\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct: 0.79\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct: 0.91\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: 0.94\n      auroc_gap_vs_constat_mmlu: -0.12\n      auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_mmlu: -0.15\n      # MMLU at 5% contamination\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_5pct: 0.58\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_5pct: 0.72\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_5pct: 0.83\n      # HellaSwag at 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_hellaswag_15pct: 0.74\n      auroc_constat_hellaswag_15pct: 0.87\n      auroc_minkpp_hellaswag_15pct: 0.92\n      auroc_gap_vs_constat_hellaswag: -0.13\n      # GSM8K at 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct: 0.63\n      auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct: 0.78\n      auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n      auroc_gap_vs_constat_gsm8k: -0.15\n      # Average gaps\n      mean_auroc_gap_vs_constat_at_15pct: -0.13\n      mean_auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_at_15pct: -0.16\n      # Type-I error at nominal α=0.05\n      type1_irt_fit: 0.06\n      type1_constat: 0.04\n      type1_minkpp: 0.03\n      # Information requirements\n      info_irt_fit: \"binary responses only\"\n      info_constat: \"binary responses + rephrased retest\"\n      info_minkpp: \"token-level probabilities\"\n      # Power-information frontier\n      pareto_optimal: \"Min-K%++ > ConStat > IRT-FIT in detection; IRT-FIT > ConStat > Min-K%++ in applicability scope\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心预测：baseline_auroc_gap_vs_constat 在 [-0.20, -0.10]。\n      \n      IRT-FIT AUROC 0.79 vs ConStat 0.91 (gap = -0.12) 在 MMLU@15% 符合预期。\n      ConStat 优势来自 rephrased retest 信号——如果模型记忆了原始 item，\n      rephrased 版本的准确率会下降，这是一个直接的 contamination indicator。\n      IRT-FIT 只能从 binary pattern 的 aberrance 间接推断，信息量先天不足。\n      \n      Min-K%++ 的 AUROC 更高（0.94）因为 token-level probabilities 提供了\n      最丰富的信号——记忆的 item 有异常低的 token surprisal。\n      \n      但信息需求也成比例增加：Min-K%++ 需要 API 返回 logprobs（很多 API 不支持），\n      ConStat 需要生成 rephrased items 并重新测试（需要 live model access），\n      IRT-FIT 只需要最终答案。在 Open LLM Leaderboard 这种场景下，\n      只有 IRT-FIT 可以对历史提交进行 retrospective analysis。\n      \n      Gap = -0.12 to -0.15 是 minimal-information 的\"代价\"——论文将这个代价\n      本身作为贡献来量化和讨论，而非试图论证 IRT-FIT 性能优于 baselines。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection AUROC Comparison (Ground-Truth Controlled Contamination)\"\n        columns: [method, info_level, \"MMLU@5%\", \"MMLU@15%\", \"MMLU@25%\", \"HellaSwag@15%\", \"GSM8K@15%\", \"ARC-C@15%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (ours)\", \"binary only\", 0.58, 0.79, 0.72, 0.74, 0.63, 0.58]\n          - [ConStat, \"binary + retest\", 0.72, 0.91, 0.88, 0.87, 0.78, 0.73]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"token probs\", 0.83, 0.94, 0.93, 0.92, 0.88, 0.84]\n        note: \"ConStat requires generating rephrased items + re-evaluating model. Min-K%++ requires token-level log-probabilities.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Power-Information Frontier\"\n        columns: [method, information_access, applicability, mean_auroc_at_15pct, unique_capability]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT\", \"Level 1: binary responses\", \"any model with benchmark scores\", 0.72, \"retrospective audit of historical submissions\"]\n          - [ConStat, \"Level 2: binary + rephrased retest\", \"live model access required\", 0.84, \"direct contamination vs memorization distinction\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Level 3: token probabilities\", \"API with logprobs\", 0.90, \"per-item contamination scoring\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power-information frontier plot — x-axis = information access level (ordinal: binary < retest < token probs < logits < weights), y-axis = mean AUROC at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT defines the leftmost (minimal-information) point. Clear monotone increasing trend. Annotated with each method's applicability scope (number of models testable).\"\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves for all three methods on MMLU@15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve clearly below but meaningfully above chance. Gap most visible in the low-FPR region (0-0.1 FPR).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 确认了 minimal-information 的代价是可量化的 ~13pp AUROC gap vs ConStat。\n      这是论文的 honest framing 而非 weakness：IRT-FIT 不是要 beat baselines，\n      而是要定义 detection frontier 的 minimal-information 端点，并量化\n      \"如果你只有 binary responses，你能做到什么\"。\n      Power-information frontier 图将成为论文的 signature figure。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Statistic\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*，\n      提供模型级整体污染指标。\n    expected_results:\n      # Implementation\n      lzm_formula: \"lzm = Σ_b w_b × lz*_b / sqrt(Σ_b w_b²) where w_b = 1/SE(lz*_b)\"\n      # Phase B 12-model validation\n      lzm_gemini15: 3.82\n      lzm_gpt4o: 2.15\n      lzm_claude35_sonnet: 1.89\n      lzm_qwen25_72b: 1.74\n      lzm_llama31_70b: 1.42\n      lzm_mean: 2.05\n      lzm_sd: 0.78\n      # Cross-benchmark improvement\n      cross_bench_consistency_before_lzm: 0.35\n      cross_bench_consistency_after_lzm: \"N/A (lzm is a single score)\"\n      lzm_vs_mean_lz_star_correlation: 0.91\n      lzm_incremental_value_over_mean: \"moderate — proper variance weighting helps for unequal benchmark sizes\"\n      # On controlled experiment data\n      lzm_auroc_ctrl_15pct: 0.82\n      lzm_vs_best_single_benchmark_auroc: \"+0.03 over MMLU alone\"\n      # Flagging\n      lzm_flagged_at_alpha005: \"4/12 models (Gemini-1.5, GPT-4o, model_X, model_Y)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Multiscale lzm 通过 inverse-variance weighting 聚合跨 benchmark 的 lz*，\n      理论上应该提高检测力（多个弱信号的联合强于任何单一信号）。\n      \n      在 median 档下，改善是\"moderate\"而非 dramatic：\n      - lzm AUROC 0.82 仅比最佳单 benchmark (MMLU, 0.79) 高 3pp，\n        因为 MMLU 的 weight 最大（n=14K, SE 最小），其他 benchmark 贡献有限。\n      - 小 benchmark (ARC-C, HumanEval) 因 SE 大，在 lzm 中几乎被 downweight 到 negligible。\n      \n      lzm 与简单 mean(lz*) 的相关性 0.91，表明 variance weighting 的增量价值有限\n      但在 benchmark 大小差异极端时（14K vs 164 items）理论上更 principled。\n      \n      实际价值更多是方法论的完整性——展示 IRT person-fit 框架可以 naturally \n      扩展到 multi-test setting，而非提供显著的 practical improvement。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm Scores for Phase B Models (Top 6)\"\n        columns: [model, lzm, rank, mmlu_lz_star, hellaswag_lz_star, gsm8k_lz_star, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro\", 3.82, 1, 31.8, 28.4, 15.2, \"strongest overall aberrance\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", 2.15, 2, 22.5, 18.9, 9.8, \"moderate aberrance\"]\n          - [\"Claude-3.5-Sonnet\", 1.89, 3, 20.1, 17.2, 8.5, \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-72B\", 1.74, 4, 19.8, 15.1, 7.2, \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-3.1-70B\", 1.42, 5, 16.2, 14.8, 6.1, \"low-moderate\"]\n          - [\"[smallest model]\", 0.45, 12, 5.2, 3.8, 2.1, \"low\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: lzm distribution across 12 Phase B models — histogram with Gemini-1.5 as clear outlier. Dashed line at lzm=1.96 (theoretical threshold). Most models above threshold due to universal misfit, but Gemini-1.5 far above the rest.\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 提供了一个 principled single-number 污染指标，但在 median 档下\n      增量检测力有限（+3pp AUROC）。其价值更多是概念性的——完成了从\n      single-benchmark lz* 到 model-level assessment 的理论扩展。\n      适合放在论文中作为 methodology contribution，但不应作为主要 selling point。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Hypothesis Test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 信号在 RL 后是否保留。\n      回应 Wang et al. (2025)。\n    expected_results:\n      # Pre-RL (SFT contaminated at 15%, from exp-ctrl-contam)\n      pre_rl_lz_star: 23.8\n      pre_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.78\n      pre_rl_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n      # Post-RL\n      post_rl_lz_star: 21.1\n      post_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.80\n      post_rl_delta_lz_star: 2.6\n      post_rl_signal_retention: 0.49\n      post_rl_still_detectable: \"marginal (p=0.08)\"\n      # Post-RL on clean model (control)\n      clean_post_rl_lz_star: 19.2\n      clean_post_rl_accuracy: 0.74\n      clean_post_rl_delta_from_clean_pre_rl: 0.7\n      # Signal attenuation\n      signal_attenuation_pct: 51\n      rl_smoothing_effect: \"GRPO redistributes probability mass, partially smoothing aberrant item-level patterns\"\n      detection_auroc_post_rl_15pct: 0.65\n      detection_auroc_pre_rl_15pct: 0.79\n    result_rationale: >\n      Wang et al. (2025) 证明 RL (PPO/DPO) 后 MIA-based 方法（Min-K%++ 等）检测力\n      大幅下降——因为 RL 重新分配了 token-level 概率分布，抹去了 memorization 的 \n      token-level 签名。\n      \n      IRT-FIT 操作在 binary response level，理论上对 token-level 变化更 robust——\n      只要模型仍然在不该答对的题目上答对，lz* 就会偏离。但 GRPO 也会部分\n      平滑 item-level patterns：(1) RL reward 通常基于 overall task performance \n      而非单 item accuracy，鼓励模型\"均匀化\"知识分布；(2) policy gradient 更新\n      可能让模型遗忘一些 SFT 过拟合的特定 items。\n      \n      Median 档预测：信号衰减约 50%（5.3 → 2.6 Δlz*），marginal detection (p=0.08)。\n      不像 MIA 方法完全失败，但也不能声称\"robust to RL\"。\n      这符合\"medium effect, conditional detection\"的整体 narrative。\n      AUROC 从 0.79 降到 0.65——仍然 above chance 但不再 reliable。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n        columns: [condition, accuracy, lz_star, delta_lz_star_from_clean, detection_p, auroc]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean (pre-RL)\", 0.71, 18.5, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Clean (post-RL)\", 0.74, 19.2, 0.7, 0.42, 0.53]\n          - [\"Contaminated 15% (pre-RL)\", 0.78, 23.8, 5.3, 0.028, 0.79]\n          - [\"Contaminated 15% (post-RL)\", 0.80, 21.1, 2.6, 0.08, 0.65]\n        note: \"GRPO training: 3 epochs, reward = accuracy on held-out reasoning tasks. Signal retention = post-RL delta / pre-RL delta = 49%.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Signal attenuation trajectory — lz* over RL training steps (0, 500, 1000, 2000, 5000 steps) for contaminated (red) and clean (blue) models. Gap narrows progressively. Annotated with AUROC at each checkpoint.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 信号衰减 ~50% 是一个 nuanced result：优于 MIA 方法的\"完全失败\"\n      但不能声称 robust。论文应这样 frame：\"IRT-FIT 的 binary-level 操作比 token-level \n      方法更 resilient to RL smoothing，但 post-RL detection 仍然是一个 open challenge。\"\n      Priority P2 合理——这是一个重要的 discussion point 但不是核心贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Extended Benchmarks — BBH and MATH\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      添加 BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n    expected_results:\n      # BBH (6511 items)\n      bbh_4pl_params_available: \"partial — PSN-IRT may have BBH but needs verification\"\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n      bbh_sim_power_5pct: 0.18\n      bbh_inverted_u_r2: 0.82\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.71\n      # MATH (5000 items)\n      math_4pl_params_available: \"likely not in PSN-IRT; may need calibration\"\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.65\n      math_sim_power_5pct: 0.14\n      math_inverted_u_r2: 0.79\n      math_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.67\n      # Filling the power gap\n      power_curve_r2_with_bbh_math: 0.93\n      power_curve_r2_without: 0.88\n      n_items_threshold_confirmation: \"≥5K items needed for AUROC>0.65 at 15%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 恰好落在 GSM8K (1319) 和 HellaSwag (10042) \n      之间，填补了 power curve 中 1K-10K 区间的数据空白。\n      \n      BBH 预期 power 0.72——接近 HellaSwag (0.733) 因为 item 数接近，\n      但 BBH 的 item 结构不同（多步推理题），可能导致 4PL 拟合更差。\n      MATH 预期 power 0.65——处于 GSM8K 和 BBH 之间。\n      \n      这两个 benchmark 的加入主要价值是让 power vs n_items 曲线拟合更精确\n      （R² 从 0.88 提升到 0.93），加强了 \"n_items threshold\" 的理论论证。\n      但 4PL 参数可用性是风险点——如果 PSN-IRT 没有这些 benchmark 的参数，\n      需要自己校准，GPU 预算可能显著增加。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Curve Data Points (Complete)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, \"sim_power@15%\", \"ctrl_auroc@15%\", source]\n        rows:\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.243, 0.54, \"existing\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.129, 0.58, \"existing\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.578, 0.63, \"existing\"]\n          - [MATH, 5000, 0.65, 0.67, \"new\"]\n          - [BBH, 6511, 0.72, 0.71, \"new\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.733, 0.74, \"existing\"]\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.979, 0.79, \"existing\"]\n        note: \"ARC-C power anomalously low for its n_items — item parameter distribution (narrow difficulty range) reduces effective information.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power vs n_items curve with all 7 benchmarks. Log-x scale. Fitted theoretical curve (from exp-power-theory) with confidence band. BBH and MATH points fall within prediction interval, confirming the theoretical relationship.\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 加强了 power-n_items 关系的实证支撑，使\"≥5K items for reliable detection\"\n      的 claim 更可信。但如果 4PL 参数需要自行校准，优先级应保持 P2——\n      这是 nice-to-have 而非 essential。\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 Gemini-1.5 的污染是全面性还是集中性。\n    expected_results:\n      n_mmlu_subjects: 57\n      n_subjects_with_sufficient_items: 42\n      min_items_per_subject_threshold: 100\n      # Gemini-1.5 domain pattern\n      gemini15_n_subjects_flagged: 38\n      gemini15_flagged_rate: 0.90\n      gemini15_domain_lz_star_mean: 5.2\n      gemini15_domain_lz_star_sd: 2.8\n      gemini15_top_aberrant_domains: [\"abstract_algebra (lz*=9.1)\", \"college_mathematics (lz*=8.7)\", \"formal_logic (lz*=8.3)\"]\n      gemini15_least_aberrant_domains: [\"high_school_us_history (lz*=1.2)\", \"world_religions (lz*=1.5)\"]\n      gemini15_stem_vs_humanities_lz_star_diff: 2.1\n      gemini15_contamination_pattern: \"broad but STEM-concentrated\"\n      # Other models\n      other_models_domain_concentration_gini: 0.45\n      domain_specificity_varies_by_model: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gemini-1.5 在 MMLU 上 100% accuracy + lz*=34.75 + θ=0.78 表明大规模污染。\n      Domain-level 分析可以区分：(1) 均匀污染（所有 subject 同样 aberrant）vs \n      (2) 集中污染（某些 domain 远比其他更 aberrant）。\n      \n      预测 Gemini-1.5 是\"broad but STEM-concentrated\"——90% 的 subjects 被标记\n      表明污染覆盖面广，但 STEM domains（数学、逻辑）的 lz* 更高，\n      可能因为这些 domain 的 item difficulty 分布更极端（有更多真正 hard items），\n      污染导致的 aberrance 更显著。文科 domain 的 items 整体较易，\n      即使没有污染高能力模型也能做对大多数，aberrance 信号更弱。\n      \n      Gini 系数 0.45 表明中等集中度——不完全均匀但也非极端集中。\n      这与\"SFT 在完整 MMLU 上训练\"的假说一致——训练覆盖所有 subject，\n      但不同 subject 的检测灵敏度取决于 item difficulty 分布。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain Analysis (Top/Bottom 5)\"\n        columns: [domain, n_items, accuracy, lz_star, flagged]\n        rows:\n          - [abstract_algebra, 100, 1.00, 9.1, \"yes\"]\n          - [college_mathematics, 100, 1.00, 8.7, \"yes\"]\n          - [formal_logic, 126, 1.00, 8.3, \"yes\"]\n          - [college_physics, 102, 1.00, 7.9, \"yes\"]\n          - [electrical_engineering, 145, 1.00, 7.5, \"yes\"]\n          - [\"...\", \"...\", \"...\", \"...\", \"...\"]\n          - [world_religions, 171, 1.00, 1.5, \"no\"]\n          - [high_school_us_history, 204, 1.00, 1.2, \"no\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MMLU domain-level lz* heatmap for Gemini-1.5 — 57 subjects sorted by lz*. Color gradient from white (low aberrance) to dark red (high aberrance). STEM cluster visually prominent. Superimposed: mean item difficulty per subject (blue line) showing correlation with lz*.\"\n      - \"Fig: STEM vs Humanities lz* boxplots for Gemini-1.5, showing significant difference (p<0.01). Other models shown as gray background for comparison — most show no STEM/Humanities lz* difference.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 为 Gemini-1.5 case study 增加了 granularity——不仅是\"flagged\"，\n      而是\"STEM-concentrated broad contamination\"。这在论文中可以用 1-2 段讨论，\n      展示 IRT-FIT 的 diagnostic 能力不仅限于 binary flagging。\n      但因为只有 Gemini-1.5 有 100% accuracy（其他模型无此极端 pattern），\n      这个分析的 generalizability 有限。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11788,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11788},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a99541df-3912-4843-939d-dd0e144f8c57","uuid":"4e712c0a-396e-4f9d-86ec-022d82218a67"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":397120,"duration_api_ms":398507,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claims 需要 scope 收窄但核心 framing 保留。Claim 1 调整为条件式检测能力声明——大 benchmark + 中高污染有效，\n  minimal-info 代价可量化。Claim 2 保留 inverted-U 但增加 boundary condition。Claim 3 缩小 audit 规模，\n  Gemini-1.5 作为 converging evidence。论文定位从 practical detector 转向 principled framework with\n  characterized operating envelope。Power-information tradeoff 的量化本身成为贡献。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Extended Simulation — High Contamination & Inverted-U Characterization\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extended-sim\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 Phase A 模拟至 60%/75%/90%/100% contamination，修复 100% boundary 处理，\n      刻画 inverted-U 拐点位置，计算 two-sided power curves。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU (14042 items)\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.979          # 复现已有结果\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.68            # 信号开始衰减——高污染 examinee 与高 ability 难分\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_75pct: 0.22            # 负向检测几乎失败\n      mmlu_power_neg_at_90pct: 0.04            # 接近零\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_60pct: 0.12            # 正向信号刚开始出现\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_75pct: 0.41            # 过度一致性可测但不强\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.73            # 正向检测可用\n      mmlu_power_pos_at_100pct: 0.88           # θ=4.0 boundary 下 lz* 显著为正\n      mmlu_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15        # 负向 power 峰值在 ~15%\n      mmlu_crossover_point: 0.58               # 正/负 power 交叉点\n      # HellaSwag (10042 items)\n      hellaswag_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.733\n      hellaswag_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.52\n      hellaswag_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.61\n      hellaswag_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15\n      # GSM8K (1319 items)\n      gsm8k_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.578\n      gsm8k_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.38\n      gsm8k_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.42\n      # ARC-C (1172 items)\n      arc_c_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.129\n      arc_c_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.31\n      # HumanEval (164 items)\n      humaneval_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.243\n      humaneval_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.18\n      # Inverted-U fit\n      inverted_u_r2_mmlu: 0.88\n      inverted_u_r2_hellaswag: 0.84\n      inverted_u_r2_gsm8k: 0.79\n      inverted_u_r2_arc_c: 0.76\n      inverted_u_r2_humaneval: 0.72\n      inverted_u_mean_r2: 0.80\n      # Two-sided combined power (max of pos/neg at each level)\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_15pct: 0.979\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_50pct: 0.68\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_75pct: 0.41\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_90pct: 0.73\n      mmlu_twosided_power_at_100pct: 0.88\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 inverted-U 结构清晰存在但 transition zone (40%-70%) 出现 detection gap——\n      负向信号衰减但正向信号尚未建立，形成 ~30pp 的 power trough。这是因为中度污染同时\n      提升了 ability estimate θ（减少 aberrance）又未达到完全一致（lz*>>0 需要几乎所有 item \n      都被预知）。MMLU 因 n=14K items 保持全程最强检测力，inverted-U R² 接近 0.9；\n      小 benchmark（ARC-C, HumanEval）因 lz* 方差大，inverted-U 拟合噪声更多，R² 降至 0.72-0.76。\n      100% contamination 在 θ=4.0 boundary 处理后可计算，lz* 显著为正但受 boundary 效应影响\n      不如理论预期极端。整体 inverted-U mean R² = 0.80 落在 tier 指标范围 [0.75, 0.90] 中段。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Two-Sided Power Matrix (Simulation)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, \"power@5%\", \"power@15%\", \"power@50%\", \"power@75%\", \"power@90%\", \"power@100%\", peak_contam, crossover]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.31, 0.98, 0.68, 0.41, 0.73, 0.88, \"15%\", \"58%\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.22, 0.73, 0.52, 0.33, 0.61, 0.78, \"15%\", \"55%\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.11, 0.58, 0.38, 0.24, 0.42, 0.51, \"10-15%\", \"52%\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.05, 0.13, 0.18, 0.14, 0.31, 0.39, \"25-50%\", \"65%\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.04, 0.24, 0.15, 0.09, 0.18, 0.22, \"15%\", \"N/A\"]\n        note: \"Power = max(P(lz*<-1.96), P(lz*>+1.96)) at each contamination level. Two-sided combined.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Inverted-U Curve Parameters\"\n        columns: [benchmark, peak_neg_power, trough_power, trough_contam_range, recovery_power_at_100pct, R2_fit]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.979, 0.41, \"70-80%\", 0.88, 0.88]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.733, 0.33, \"65-80%\", 0.78, 0.84]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.578, 0.24, \"60-80%\", 0.51, 0.79]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.129, 0.13, \"15-50%\", 0.39, 0.76]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.243, 0.09, \"60-85%\", 0.22, 0.72]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Inverted-U power curves per benchmark (x=contamination%, y=detection power), showing negative-side (blue, dashed) and positive-side (red, dashed) power separately, plus two-sided envelope (black, solid). Shaded gray band marks the detection trough zone. MMLU curve clearly U-shaped; HumanEval curve nearly flat with wide confidence bands.\"\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of detection power (contamination level × benchmark), color-coded green (>0.8) / yellow (0.5-0.8) / red (<0.5). Clear diagonal pattern: large benchmarks green at moderate contamination, small benchmarks mostly red/yellow throughout.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Inverted-U 在 MMLU 和 HellaSwag 上结构清晰——峰值在 15% 左右，trough 在 70-80%，\n      100% 恢复至 0.78-0.88。但小 benchmark 的 inverted-U 更像一条低矮的丘陵而非清晰的 U 型。\n      这为 Claim 2 提供支持但需要加 boundary condition：inverted-U 的理论形状成立，\n      但只有 n_items ≥ 5K 时 peak power 才超过 0.7，使检测具有实际意义。\n      Detection trough（40-70%）是一个必须在论文中诚实报告的盲区。\n\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot — Go/No-Go\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz* 是否显著。\n      论文 go/no-go 决策点。\n    expected_results:\n      # Baseline (0% contamination, clean model)\n      qwen_clean_mmlu_accuracy: 0.71\n      qwen_clean_mmlu_theta: 1.05\n      qwen_clean_mmlu_lz_star: 18.5\n      # 15% contamination\n      qwen_15pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.78\n      qwen_15pct_mmlu_theta: 1.42\n      qwen_15pct_mmlu_lz_star: 23.8\n      qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n      qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star_cohen_d: 1.2\n      qwen_15pct_delta_accuracy: 0.07\n      # 50% contamination\n      qwen_50pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.89\n      qwen_50pct_mmlu_theta: 2.31\n      qwen_50pct_mmlu_lz_star: 14.2\n      qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star: -4.3\n      qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star_direction: \"decreased (toward normal or positive)\"\n      qwen_50pct_delta_accuracy: 0.18\n      # Statistical tests\n      ttest_clean_vs_15pct_p: 0.028\n      ttest_clean_vs_50pct_p: 0.11\n      bootstrap_ci_delta_15pct: [1.8, 8.9]\n      bootstrap_ci_delta_50pct: [-9.1, 0.5]\n      # Go/no-go\n      go_signal: \"CONDITIONAL GO\"\n      go_signal_detail: \"Δlz* significant at 15% but inverted-U already visible at 50%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：SFT 注入后 Δlz* 存在但效应量中等。Clean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上\n      已经有高 lz*（~18.5），因为所有 LLM 都违反 IRT 假设（Phase B 已证实 universal misfit）。\n      15% SFT 污染在 14K-item MMLU 上产生足够多的 aberrant responses——模型在本不该答对的\n      hard items（低 θ 区域）上答对，lz* 进一步偏离，Cohen's d ~1.2 可检测。但 50% 污染\n      触发 inverted-U 效应：大量 item 被记忆后 θ 估计大幅上升（1.05→2.31），模型看起来\n      像一个\"真正高能力\"的 examinee，aberrance pattern 被 smoothed——lz* 反而回落甚至\n      可能低于 baseline。SFT 泛化效应（domain 内未直接训练 items 的准确率也提升）进一步\n      稀释了 aberrance 信号。这给出 conditional go：15% 有信号，但 50% 的 inverted-U 效应\n      意味着高污染检测需要依赖正向 lz* 阈值，而 50% 可能恰好落在 trough zone。\n      P 值在 15% 边缘显著（0.028），50% 不显著（0.11）——因为 Δ 方向反转且 variance 大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pilot Results — Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU\"\n        columns: [condition, accuracy, theta, lz_star, delta_lz_star, cohen_d, p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (clean)\", 0.71, 1.05, 18.5, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"15%\", 0.78, 1.42, 23.8, +5.3, 1.2, 0.028]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.89, 2.31, 14.2, -4.3, 0.9, 0.11]\n        note: \"lz* computed with benchmark-specific θ and bootstrap (n=1000). Cohen's d = |Δlz*| / pooled_sd across 3 random seeds.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart with 3 conditions (clean/15%/50%), y-axis = lz*, error bars = bootstrap 95% CI. Shows non-monotonic pattern: lz* rises at 15% then drops at 50%, illustrating inverted-U in real SFT data.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot of per-subject accuracy delta (y) vs per-subject lz* delta (x) at 15% contamination. Shows that subjects with largest accuracy gains also have largest lz* increase — contamination signal is concentrated in directly trained domains.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 给出 conditional go。15% 的 Δlz* = +5.3 (Cohen's d = 1.2) 在 MMLU 上显著，\n      证明 SFT 污染可被 person-fit 检测。但 50% 的信号反转确认了 inverted-U 在真实 SFT 数据中\n      存在，且 trough 比模拟更早出现（模拟中 trough 在 70-80%，实际 50% 已开始回落），\n      可能因为 SFT 泛化效应（domain-level accuracy boost）提前了 θ 上升。\n      Go/no-go 判定：GO，但需要在完整实验中加入 25% 污染水平以精确定位 real-data inverted-U peak。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B × 6 contamination levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%) × 5 benchmarks。\n      建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 完整映射。\n    expected_results:\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, MMLU (14042 items) ===\n      qwen_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 18.5\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_lz_star: 19.8\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_delta: 1.3\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_cohen_d: 0.3\n      qwen_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.58\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_lz_star: 21.6\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_delta: 3.1\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_cohen_d: 0.7\n      qwen_mmlu_10pct_auroc: 0.68\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_lz_star: 23.8\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_delta: 5.3\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 1.2\n      qwen_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.79\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_lz_star: 22.1\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_delta: 3.6\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n      qwen_mmlu_25pct_auroc: 0.72\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_lz_star: 14.2\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_delta: -4.3\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n      qwen_mmlu_50pct_auroc: 0.64\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, HellaSwag (10042 items) ===\n      qwen_hellaswag_clean_lz_star: 15.2\n      qwen_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.8\n      qwen_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n      qwen_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.74\n      qwen_hellaswag_5pct_auroc: 0.55\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, GSM8K (1319 items) ===\n      qwen_gsm8k_clean_lz_star: 6.1\n      qwen_gsm8k_15pct_delta: 1.9\n      qwen_gsm8k_15pct_cohen_d: 0.6\n      qwen_gsm8k_15pct_auroc: 0.63\n      qwen_gsm8k_5pct_auroc: 0.52\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, ARC-C (1172 items) ===\n      qwen_arcc_clean_lz_star: 4.8\n      qwen_arcc_15pct_delta: 1.1\n      qwen_arcc_15pct_cohen_d: 0.4\n      qwen_arcc_15pct_auroc: 0.58\n      qwen_arcc_5pct_auroc: 0.51\n      # === Qwen3.5-9B, HumanEval (164 items) ===\n      qwen_humaneval_clean_lz_star: 2.3\n      qwen_humaneval_15pct_delta: 0.6\n      qwen_humaneval_15pct_cohen_d: 0.2\n      qwen_humaneval_15pct_auroc: 0.54\n      # === Gemma-4-31B, MMLU ===\n      gemma_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 22.1\n      gemma_mmlu_15pct_delta: 4.1\n      gemma_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 0.95\n      gemma_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.76\n      gemma_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.56\n      # === Gemma-4-31B, HellaSwag ===\n      gemma_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.2\n      gemma_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n      gemma_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.71\n      # === Cross-model consistency ===\n      cross_model_delta_direction_agreement_15pct: \"5/5 benchmarks same direction\"\n      cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_mmlu: 1.29\n      cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_hellaswag: 1.19\n      cross_model_spearman_delta_across_benchmarks: 0.70\n      # === SFT generalization effect ===\n      sft_generalization_domain_accuracy_boost: 0.03\n      sft_generalization_nontrained_item_accuracy_delta: 0.02\n      # === Summary thresholds ===\n      n_conditions_auroc_above_0.7: \"4/12 (MMLU×2models + HellaSwag×2models at 15%)\"\n      n_conditions_auroc_above_0.8: \"0/12\"\n      overall_detection_threshold: \"≥15% contamination AND ≥5K items\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档的核心预测：Cohen's d 在 0.8-2.0 之间，仅 ≥15% + ≥5K items 可靠分离。\n      \n      5% 污染检测力不足（AUROC < 0.70）——因为 5% 对应 MMLU 仅 ~700 items 被记忆，\n      产生的 aberrant pattern 在 14K-item 的 lz* 计算中被 noise 淹没。SFT 泛化效应\n      使未直接训练的同 domain items 也提升了 ~2-3pp 准确率，进一步稀释信号。\n      \n      15% 是 sweet spot——~2100 items 产生足够 aberrance，且 θ 尚未被推高到 \n      identifiability collapse 区域。但即使在 MMLU 上 AUROC 也只有 0.79 而非 0.95+，\n      因为 baseline lz* 已经很高（~18.5），Δlz* = 5.3 相对于 baseline variance 只是中等效应。\n      \n      25% 开始出现 inverted-U 衰减——θ 上升使部分 hard items 变得\"合理答对\"，\n      aberrance 减少。50% 信号反转。\n      \n      小 benchmark（ARC-C 1172 items, HumanEval 164 items）在所有污染水平下\n      都无法可靠检测——lz* 的 sampling variance 与 n_items^(-1/2) 成正比，\n      164 items 的 SE 比 14K items 大 ~9 倍。\n      \n      跨模型方向一致（两个模型在 5/5 benchmarks 上 Δlz* 同向），但幅度差异\n      20-30%——Gemma-4-31B baseline 更强（θ 更高），留给污染信号的\"空间\"更小。\n      这符合 tier 预测的\"方向一致但幅度差异大\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC by Contamination Level × Benchmark (Qwen3.5-9B)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, \"AUROC@5%\", \"AUROC@10%\", \"AUROC@15%\", \"AUROC@25%\", \"AUROC@50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.58, 0.68, 0.79, 0.72, 0.64]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.55, 0.63, 0.74, 0.68, 0.59]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.52, 0.57, 0.63, 0.60, 0.55]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.51, 0.54, 0.58, 0.56, 0.53]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.50, 0.52, 0.54, 0.53, 0.51]\n        note: \"AUROC computed over 3 seeds per condition. Chance = 0.50.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Cohen's d at 15% Contamination — Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [benchmark, qwen_d, gemma_d, direction_agree, magnitude_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 1.2, 0.95, \"yes\", 1.26]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.9, 0.8, \"yes\", 1.13]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.6, 0.5, \"yes\", 1.20]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.4, 0.3, \"yes\", 1.33]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.2, 0.15, \"yes\", 1.33]\n      - name: \"Table: SFT Generalization Analysis (Qwen3.5-9B, MMLU, 15%)\"\n        columns: [item_category, n_items, accuracy_clean, accuracy_contam, delta_acc, delta_lz_star_contribution]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Directly trained items\", 2106, 0.65, 0.94, +0.29, \"dominant signal source\"]\n          - [\"Same-domain untrained\", 4200, 0.70, 0.73, +0.03, \"noise / dilution\"]\n          - [\"Other-domain items\", 7736, 0.73, 0.74, +0.01, \"negligible\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Δlz* dose-response curves for both models × MMLU. X-axis = contamination level, Y-axis = Δlz* from clean baseline. Inverted-U clearly visible: peak at 15-25%, crossing zero around 40-50%. Qwen curve consistently above Gemma by ~1-2 lz* units. Error bars (3 seeds) overlap at 5% and 50% but separate at 15%.\"\n      - \"Fig: AUROC heatmap (contamination level × benchmark × model). 2×5×5 grid. Only the top-left quadrant (≥15% × ≥5K items) is green (>0.70). Strong diagonal gradient from top-left to bottom-right.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-item analysis at 15% contamination — scatter of item difficulty (b parameter) vs P(correct|contaminated) - P(correct|clean). Directly trained items cluster in high-difficulty, high-delta region. SFT generalization items show small diffuse delta.\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：IRT-FIT 在 controlled contamination 下给出 medium-effect detection，\n      operating envelope 为 ≥15% contamination + ≥5K items + negative-lz* regime。\n      这不是一个 practical detector（AUROC 未超过 0.80），但成功量化了 minimal-information \n      的代价——同样 ground-truth 数据上 ConStat 预期 AUROC 0.85-0.95（需 exp-baseline-comparison 确认）。\n      SFT 泛化效应是信号衰减的主要原因之一——约 3pp 的 domain-level accuracy boost \n      让 ~30% 的非训练 items 也被答对，稀释了 aberrance pattern。\n      论文需要诚实报告 operating envelope 并将 power-information tradeoff 作为核心贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Theoretical Power Derivation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-power-theory\"\n    description: >\n      基于 Snijders (2001) lz* 方差公式推导 power ∝ f(n_items, contam_rate) 的解析关系，\n      验证理论曲线与模拟的拟合度，建立 inverted-U 的理论基础。\n    expected_results:\n      # Theoretical power formula fit to simulation\n      theory_vs_sim_r2_negative_regime: 0.91\n      theory_vs_sim_r2_positive_regime: 0.83\n      theory_vs_sim_r2_combined: 0.85\n      # Derived thresholds\n      min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_15pct: 8200\n      min_n_items_for_power_0.5_at_15pct: 2800\n      min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_5pct: \">50000 (extrapolated)\"\n      # Inverted-U theoretical parameters\n      inverted_u_peak_formula: \"contam_peak ≈ σ²(θ) / (2 × E[I(θ)]) — depends on ability variance and test information\"\n      inverted_u_peak_predicted_mmlu: 0.17\n      inverted_u_peak_observed_mmlu: 0.15\n      inverted_u_trough_depth_formula: \"proportional to n_items^(-1/2) × contam_rate × (1 - contam_rate)\"\n      # Key theoretical insight\n      power_scaling: \"Power ∝ sqrt(n_items) × contam_rate × g(θ_shift) where g is a non-monotone function capturing the inverted-U\"\n      identifiability_collapse_threshold: \"contam_rate at which E[θ_contam] > θ_max_discriminating ≈ 3.0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Snijders (2001) 给出 Var(lz*) ≈ 1 + O(1/n) 在零假设下。污染注入等价于\n      向 response vector 添加 n×c 个\"能力不匹配\"的正确回答（c = contamination rate）。\n      \n      在负向 regime（低-中污染），lz* 的期望偏移 ∝ sqrt(n) × c × Σ[log P_j(θ) 的 aberrance term]，\n      power 随 sqrt(n) 增长——这解释了为什么 MMLU (14K) 的 power 远超 ARC-C (1172)。\n      理论与模拟在负向 regime 拟合良好（R² = 0.91），因为 Snijders 的正态近似在\n      大 n 下准确。\n      \n      正向 regime 拟合较差（R² = 0.83）因为 identifiability collapse 涉及 θ 估计的\n      boundary 效应——当 θ → ∞ 时 MLE 不稳定，理论公式的渐近近似失效。\n      这也是 median 档的体现：理论框架基本成立但在边界条件下精度降低。\n      \n      min_n_items 阈值计算表明 5% 污染在任何现有 benchmark 上都不可检测\n      （需 >50K items），支持 \"scope 收窄\" 的叙事——IRT-FIT 不是万能探测器，\n      它在特定 operating envelope 内工作。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Theoretical vs Simulated Power\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, sim_power_15pct, theory_power_15pct, residual, sim_power_5pct, theory_power_5pct, residual_5pct]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.979, 0.96, +0.019, 0.31, 0.28, +0.03]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.733, 0.75, -0.017, 0.22, 0.20, +0.02]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.578, 0.54, +0.038, 0.11, 0.10, +0.01]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.129, 0.15, -0.021, 0.05, 0.06, -0.01]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.243, 0.21, +0.033, 0.04, 0.04, 0.00]\n        note: \"ARC-C 偏差大因为 item parameters 分布偏离理论假设（难度集中在窄范围）\"\n      - name: \"Table: Minimum n_items for Target Power\"\n        columns: [target_power, contam_5pct, contam_10pct, contam_15pct, contam_25pct]\n        rows:\n          - [0.50, \">50K\", 12000, 2800, 900]\n          - [0.80, \">50K\", 25000, 8200, 2200]\n          - [0.90, \">50K\", 40000, 12500, 3500]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power surface — 3D plot with axes (n_items, contamination_rate, power). Theoretical surface in translucent blue, simulation data points as red dots. Good agreement in the low-contamination quadrant, visible divergence at high-contamination + small-n corner.\"\n      - \"Fig: Inverted-U decomposition — theoretical curves showing negative-lz* contribution (monotone decreasing in contam_rate) and positive-lz* contribution (monotone increasing), with their sum producing the U shape. Annotated with the peak location formula.\"\n    analysis: >\n      理论推导成功建立了 power-n_items-contamination 的解析关系，inverted-U 从经验观察\n      升级为可推导的理论命题。关键贡献是 minimum n_items 表格——这给审稿人和用户一个\n      直接可用的查询工具。理论与模拟的 combined R² = 0.85 表明理论框架基本正确，\n      但需要承认在 identifiability collapse 附近的近似误差。\n      这是论文的一个坚实理论贡献，即使检测力本身是 medium。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Data Reconnaissance\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-data-recon\"\n    description: >\n      调研 HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 per-item binary response data 可用性、格式、覆盖范围。\n    expected_results:\n      hf_results_repo_exists: true\n      per_item_binary_logs_available: \"partial\"\n      format: \"JSON with per-example predictions, not standardized across all models\"\n      n_models_total_in_leaderboard: 7000+\n      n_models_with_per_item_data: 280\n      n_models_with_complete_5benchmark_data: 150\n      benchmarks_covered: [\"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"ARC-C\", \"TruthfulQA\", \"Winogrande\", \"GSM8K\"]\n      data_format_issues: \"variable JSON schema across submission dates; some models only have aggregate scores; harness version differences (lm-eval v0.3 vs v0.4)\"\n      estimated_gpu_hours_to_supplement: 120\n      recommendation: \"proceed with 150-280 available models; supplement top-50 missing flagships via inference\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1（2023-2024 运行）使用 lm-evaluation-harness，\n      其结果存储在 open-llm-leaderboard-old/results repo 中。该 repo 包含 per-model \n      结果目录，但格式不统一——早期提交只有 aggregate JSON，后期版本包含 per-example logs。\n      \n      Median 档预测 100-500 models 有 per-item data。实际可能约 280 个模型有可用的\n      per-item 级别数据，因为 lm-eval-harness 在某个版本后开始默认保存 per-example \n      predictions，但不是所有提交者都上传了完整日志。150 个模型有完整 5-benchmark 数据，\n      足够进行 IRT 参数估计和 person-fit 计算。\n      \n      这是 median 档的典型场景——数据部分可用，需要工程投入去解析不统一的格式，\n      但不需要从零开始跑推理。280 个模型比 Phase B 的 12 个大 23 倍，\n      足以支撑 Claim 3 的 leaderboard audit，但无法声称是\"全面扫描\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Data Availability Summary\"\n        columns: [category, count, pct_of_total, notes]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total models on leaderboard\", 7200, \"100%\", \"\"]\n          - [\"Models with any results JSON\", 5800, \"80.6%\", \"some only aggregate\"]\n          - [\"Models with per-item predictions\", 280, \"3.9%\", \"lm-eval ≥v0.4\"]\n          - [\"Models with complete 5-bench per-item\", 150, \"2.1%\", \"usable for IRT-FIT\"]\n          - [\"Top-50 flagships missing per-item\", 38, \"—\", \"would need inference runs\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Timeline of per-item data availability on leaderboard — x-axis = submission date, y-axis = cumulative models with per-item data. Sharp uptick after lm-eval v0.4 release, plateau when leaderboard v1 closed.\"\n    analysis: >\n      280 models with per-item data 落在 tier 预测的 [100, 500] 范围内。\n      足够支撑 leaderboard audit 但需要在论文中明确说明覆盖率限制。\n      建议策略：用 280 个可用模型做主分析，补充 top-50 缺失的旗舰模型（约 38 个需推理），\n      总计 ~320 个模型。GPU 补充预算 ~20 hrs（38 models × ~0.5 hr each）可控。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit — Large-Scale Person-Fit Scan\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      对 ~280+ 可用模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit，绘制污染率趋势，\n      识别系统性异常模型。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_analyzed: 310\n      n_benchmarks: 5\n      total_model_benchmark_cells: 1550\n      # Flagging results (relative to controlled-contamination calibrated thresholds)\n      flagged_rate_mmlu_delta_method: 0.22\n      flagged_rate_hellaswag_delta_method: 0.18\n      flagged_rate_gsm8k_delta_method: 0.28\n      flagged_rate_arcc_delta_method: 0.15\n      flagged_rate_humaneval_delta_method: 0.12\n      overall_flagged_rate: 0.19\n      # Notable findings\n      n_models_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 18\n      n_models_flagged_all_5: 3\n      top_flagged_model_1: \"Gemini-1.5-Pro (4/5 benchmarks, highest Δlz* on MMLU)\"\n      top_flagged_model_2: \"model_family_X (multiple sizes all flagged — systematic)\"\n      top_flagged_model_3: \"model_Y (GSM8K + MATH specialist, extreme negative lz* on math benchmarks)\"\n      # Temporal trend\n      flagged_rate_2023h1: 0.12\n      flagged_rate_2023h2: 0.18\n      flagged_rate_2024h1: 0.25\n      temporal_trend_significant: true\n      temporal_trend_spearman: 0.38\n      # Cross-benchmark correlation (group level)\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_hellaswag: 0.31\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_gsm8k: 0.22\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_mean: 0.35\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_n_significant: \"3/10 pairs\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 leaderboard_flagged_rate_relative 在 [0.1, 0.4]，cross_benchmark_spearman \n      在 [0.3, 0.6]。\n      \n      Overall flagged rate ~19% 反映了两个因素的叠加：(1) 确实存在的 benchmark gaming——\n      开源社区中\"benchmark hacking\"是公开的秘密，部分模型在 MMLU/GSM8K 训练集上做过 SFT；\n      (2) Δlz* calibration 的不完美——controlled experiment 建立的阈值基于 2 个模型，\n      可能对其他架构/训练策略不够 robust，产生一定 false positives。\n      \n      时间趋势（12%→25%）有真实基础：2023 下半年到 2024 年，leaderboard 竞争加剧，\n      更多模型被发现在 benchmark data 上训练。但趋势的 effect size 中等（Spearman 0.38），\n      因为早期模型中也有污染（只是比例低）且后期有些模型反而更注意避免。\n      \n      Cross-benchmark 相关性弱到中等（mean 0.35）——这是 median 档的关键特征。\n      如果污染是系统性的（同一训练流程污染所有 benchmark），相关性应该高；\n      但实际上很多模型只在特定 benchmark 上有异常（如只刷 GSM8K 或只刷 MMLU），\n      导致 per-benchmark 信号不一致。3/10 pairs 显著优于 Phase B 的 1/10，\n      但仍然不足以支撑\"全面跨 benchmark 一致性\"的强声明。\n      \n      18 个模型在 3+ benchmarks 被标记——这些是最可信的 converging evidence cases，\n      论文应聚焦于这些而非整体 flagged rate。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Leaderboard Flagged Rate by Benchmark\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, n_models, flagged_count, flagged_rate, median_delta_lz_star_flagged, \"95%CI_flagged_rate\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 310, 68, 0.22, 4.8, \"[0.17, 0.27]\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 310, 56, 0.18, 3.5, \"[0.14, 0.23]\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 310, 87, 0.28, 2.1, \"[0.23, 0.33]\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 310, 47, 0.15, 1.4, \"[0.11, 0.20]\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 310, 37, 0.12, 0.8, \"[0.08, 0.16]\"]\n        note: \"Flagging based on Δlz* > threshold calibrated from exp-ctrl-contam (15% contamination boundary). GSM8K high rate may reflect both real contamination AND low-n-items false positives.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagged Models\"\n        columns: [n_benchmarks_flagged, n_models, example_models]\n        rows:\n          - [5, 3, \"Gemini-1.5-Pro, model_A, model_B\"]\n          - [4, 7, \"model_C, model_D, ...\"]\n          - [3, 8, \"model_E, model_F, ...\"]\n          - [2, 23, \"—\"]\n          - [1, 18, \"—\"]\n          - [0, 251, \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Temporal Contamination Trend\"\n        columns: [period, n_models, flagged_any, flagged_rate, \"flagged_≥3_bench\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2023 H1\", 85, 10, 0.12, 1]\n          - [\"2023 H2\", 120, 22, 0.18, 5]\n          - [\"2024 H1\", 105, 26, 0.25, 12]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Leaderboard contamination landscape — scatter of models by (x=mean_accuracy, y=mean_delta_lz_star), color-coded by number of benchmarks flagged (0=gray, 1=yellow, 2=orange, 3+=red). High-accuracy + high-Δlz* quadrant contains the most suspicious models. Gemini-1.5 is an obvious outlier.\"\n      - \"Fig: Temporal trend — stacked bar chart by submission half-year, showing flagged (red) vs clean (gray) models. Increasing red proportion over time.\"\n      - \"Fig: Cross-benchmark Δlz* correlation matrix (10 pairs), with significant correlations highlighted. Mostly weak (0.2-0.4) with 3 significant pairs.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 给出 median-range 结果：19% overall flagged rate，时间趋势存在但中等，\n      cross-benchmark 一致性弱。论文应采用保守叙事策略：聚焦于 18 个 multi-benchmark flagged \n      模型作为 high-confidence cases，报告整体 flagged rate 作为 upper bound estimate，\n      明确说明 false positive rate 由 controlled experiment calibration 的 transferability 限制。\n      Gemini-1.5 case study 从\"定义性证据\"降级为\"与 leaderboard-wide pattern 一致的 converging evidence\"。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) vs 3PL (d=1 fixed) 下 detection sensitivity 差异。\n    expected_results:\n      # Simulation comparison\n      sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.979\n      sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.952\n      sim_power_delta_mmlu: -0.027\n      sim_power_4pl_arcc_15pct: 0.129\n      sim_power_3pl_arcc_15pct: 0.108\n      sim_power_delta_arcc: -0.021\n      # False alarm comparison\n      sim_fpr_4pl_alpha005: 0.048\n      sim_fpr_3pl_alpha005: 0.062\n      # Effect on real data\n      real_data_flagged_4pl: 57\n      real_data_flagged_3pl: 54\n      real_data_agreement: \"52/60 cells agree\"\n      # d parameter analysis\n      mean_d_across_benchmarks: 0.92\n      pct_items_d_lt_0.9: 0.31\n      d_impact_on_lz_star_correlation: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL 的 feasibility parameter d < 1 表示即使完全掌握 item 也无法保证答对\n      （如题目表述模糊或 label 有误）。当 d 接近 1 时 4PL ≈ 3PL。\n      \n      PSN-IRT 估计的平均 d = 0.92，说明大多数 items d 接近 1，\n      但有 ~31% 的 items d < 0.9（可能是有噪声的标注）。\n      \n      在 median 档下，d 参数的影响是可测但不大的：\n      - 4PL 的 lz* 对 high-ability examinees 更宽容（因为 d<1 意味着满分不太可能），\n        这略微提高了检测灵敏度（~2-3pp power improvement）。\n      - 在 false alarm 控制上 4PL 更好（0.048 vs 0.062），因为 3PL 在 d<1 items 上\n        会过度惩罚\"答错高概率题目\"的 pattern。\n      - 但整体差异不大：4PL vs 3PL 的 lz* 相关性 0.97，flagging 一致率 87%。\n      \n      这个 ablation 的贡献是 confirming rather than surprising——4PL 略优但 3PL 也可用，\n      意味着方法对 item parameter 选择不过度敏感。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power (Simulation)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, \"power_4PL@15%\", \"power_3PL@15%\", delta, \"FPR_4PL\", \"FPR_3PL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.979, 0.952, -0.027, 0.048, 0.062]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.733, 0.711, -0.022, 0.045, 0.058]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.578, 0.559, -0.019, 0.051, 0.065]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.129, 0.108, -0.021, 0.049, 0.067]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.243, 0.228, -0.015, 0.052, 0.061]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter of lz*_4PL vs lz*_3PL across all (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect linear relationship (r=0.97) with slight divergence at extremes. Color-coded by mean item d parameter of benchmark.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL 提供一致但微小的改进（~2-3pp power, ~1.5pp FPR reduction）。\n      足以证明 d 参数有理论和实证价值，但不是方法的核心驱动因素。\n      论文建议：主实验用 4PL，附录报告 3PL 结果作为 robustness check。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison — IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在 controlled contamination ground-truth 上比较 IRT-FIT、ConStat、Min-K%++ 的检测能力，\n      量化 minimal-information 的代价。\n    expected_results:\n      # MMLU at 15% contamination (primary comparison point)\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct: 0.79\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct: 0.91\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: 0.94\n      auroc_gap_vs_constat_mmlu: -0.12\n      auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_mmlu: -0.15\n      # MMLU at 5% contamination\n      auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_5pct: 0.58\n      auroc_constat_mmlu_5pct: 0.72\n      auroc_minkpp_mmlu_5pct: 0.83\n      # HellaSwag at 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_hellaswag_15pct: 0.74\n      auroc_constat_hellaswag_15pct: 0.87\n      auroc_minkpp_hellaswag_15pct: 0.92\n      auroc_gap_vs_constat_hellaswag: -0.13\n      # GSM8K at 15%\n      auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct: 0.63\n      auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct: 0.78\n      auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n      auroc_gap_vs_constat_gsm8k: -0.15\n      # Average gaps\n      mean_auroc_gap_vs_constat_at_15pct: -0.13\n      mean_auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_at_15pct: -0.16\n      # Type-I error at nominal α=0.05\n      type1_irt_fit: 0.06\n      type1_constat: 0.04\n      type1_minkpp: 0.03\n      # Information requirements\n      info_irt_fit: \"binary responses only\"\n      info_constat: \"binary responses + rephrased retest\"\n      info_minkpp: \"token-level probabilities\"\n      # Power-information frontier\n      pareto_optimal: \"Min-K%++ > ConStat > IRT-FIT in detection; IRT-FIT > ConStat > Min-K%++ in applicability scope\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心预测：baseline_auroc_gap_vs_constat 在 [-0.20, -0.10]。\n      \n      IRT-FIT AUROC 0.79 vs ConStat 0.91 (gap = -0.12) 在 MMLU@15% 符合预期。\n      ConStat 优势来自 rephrased retest 信号——如果模型记忆了原始 item，\n      rephrased 版本的准确率会下降，这是一个直接的 contamination indicator。\n      IRT-FIT 只能从 binary pattern 的 aberrance 间接推断，信息量先天不足。\n      \n      Min-K%++ 的 AUROC 更高（0.94）因为 token-level probabilities 提供了\n      最丰富的信号——记忆的 item 有异常低的 token surprisal。\n      \n      但信息需求也成比例增加：Min-K%++ 需要 API 返回 logprobs（很多 API 不支持），\n      ConStat 需要生成 rephrased items 并重新测试（需要 live model access），\n      IRT-FIT 只需要最终答案。在 Open LLM Leaderboard 这种场景下，\n      只有 IRT-FIT 可以对历史提交进行 retrospective analysis。\n      \n      Gap = -0.12 to -0.15 是 minimal-information 的\"代价\"——论文将这个代价\n      本身作为贡献来量化和讨论，而非试图论证 IRT-FIT 性能优于 baselines。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection AUROC Comparison (Ground-Truth Controlled Contamination)\"\n        columns: [method, info_level, \"MMLU@5%\", \"MMLU@15%\", \"MMLU@25%\", \"HellaSwag@15%\", \"GSM8K@15%\", \"ARC-C@15%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (ours)\", \"binary only\", 0.58, 0.79, 0.72, 0.74, 0.63, 0.58]\n          - [ConStat, \"binary + retest\", 0.72, 0.91, 0.88, 0.87, 0.78, 0.73]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"token probs\", 0.83, 0.94, 0.93, 0.92, 0.88, 0.84]\n        note: \"ConStat requires generating rephrased items + re-evaluating model. Min-K%++ requires token-level log-probabilities.\"\n      - name: \"Table: Power-Information Frontier\"\n        columns: [method, information_access, applicability, mean_auroc_at_15pct, unique_capability]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT\", \"Level 1: binary responses\", \"any model with benchmark scores\", 0.72, \"retrospective audit of historical submissions\"]\n          - [ConStat, \"Level 2: binary + rephrased retest\", \"live model access required\", 0.84, \"direct contamination vs memorization distinction\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Level 3: token probabilities\", \"API with logprobs\", 0.90, \"per-item contamination scoring\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power-information frontier plot — x-axis = information access level (ordinal: binary < retest < token probs < logits < weights), y-axis = mean AUROC at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT defines the leftmost (minimal-information) point. Clear monotone increasing trend. Annotated with each method's applicability scope (number of models testable).\"\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves for all three methods on MMLU@15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve clearly below but meaningfully above chance. Gap most visible in the low-FPR region (0-0.1 FPR).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 确认了 minimal-information 的代价是可量化的 ~13pp AUROC gap vs ConStat。\n      这是论文的 honest framing 而非 weakness：IRT-FIT 不是要 beat baselines，\n      而是要定义 detection frontier 的 minimal-information 端点，并量化\n      \"如果你只有 binary responses，你能做到什么\"。\n      Power-information frontier 图将成为论文的 signature figure。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Statistic\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*，\n      提供模型级整体污染指标。\n    expected_results:\n      # Implementation\n      lzm_formula: \"lzm = Σ_b w_b × lz*_b / sqrt(Σ_b w_b²) where w_b = 1/SE(lz*_b)\"\n      # Phase B 12-model validation\n      lzm_gemini15: 3.82\n      lzm_gpt4o: 2.15\n      lzm_claude35_sonnet: 1.89\n      lzm_qwen25_72b: 1.74\n      lzm_llama31_70b: 1.42\n      lzm_mean: 2.05\n      lzm_sd: 0.78\n      # Cross-benchmark improvement\n      cross_bench_consistency_before_lzm: 0.35\n      cross_bench_consistency_after_lzm: \"N/A (lzm is a single score)\"\n      lzm_vs_mean_lz_star_correlation: 0.91\n      lzm_incremental_value_over_mean: \"moderate — proper variance weighting helps for unequal benchmark sizes\"\n      # On controlled experiment data\n      lzm_auroc_ctrl_15pct: 0.82\n      lzm_vs_best_single_benchmark_auroc: \"+0.03 over MMLU alone\"\n      # Flagging\n      lzm_flagged_at_alpha005: \"4/12 models (Gemini-1.5, GPT-4o, model_X, model_Y)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Multiscale lzm 通过 inverse-variance weighting 聚合跨 benchmark 的 lz*，\n      理论上应该提高检测力（多个弱信号的联合强于任何单一信号）。\n      \n      在 median 档下，改善是\"moderate\"而非 dramatic：\n      - lzm AUROC 0.82 仅比最佳单 benchmark (MMLU, 0.79) 高 3pp，\n        因为 MMLU 的 weight 最大（n=14K, SE 最小），其他 benchmark 贡献有限。\n      - 小 benchmark (ARC-C, HumanEval) 因 SE 大，在 lzm 中几乎被 downweight 到 negligible。\n      \n      lzm 与简单 mean(lz*) 的相关性 0.91，表明 variance weighting 的增量价值有限\n      但在 benchmark 大小差异极端时（14K vs 164 items）理论上更 principled。\n      \n      实际价值更多是方法论的完整性——展示 IRT person-fit 框架可以 naturally \n      扩展到 multi-test setting，而非提供显著的 practical improvement。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm Scores for Phase B Models (Top 6)\"\n        columns: [model, lzm, rank, mmlu_lz_star, hellaswag_lz_star, gsm8k_lz_star, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro\", 3.82, 1, 31.8, 28.4, 15.2, \"strongest overall aberrance\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", 2.15, 2, 22.5, 18.9, 9.8, \"moderate aberrance\"]\n          - [\"Claude-3.5-Sonnet\", 1.89, 3, 20.1, 17.2, 8.5, \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-72B\", 1.74, 4, 19.8, 15.1, 7.2, \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-3.1-70B\", 1.42, 5, 16.2, 14.8, 6.1, \"low-moderate\"]\n          - [\"[smallest model]\", 0.45, 12, 5.2, 3.8, 2.1, \"low\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: lzm distribution across 12 Phase B models — histogram with Gemini-1.5 as clear outlier. Dashed line at lzm=1.96 (theoretical threshold). Most models above threshold due to universal misfit, but Gemini-1.5 far above the rest.\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 提供了一个 principled single-number 污染指标，但在 median 档下\n      增量检测力有限（+3pp AUROC）。其价值更多是概念性的——完成了从\n      single-benchmark lz* 到 model-level assessment 的理论扩展。\n      适合放在论文中作为 methodology contribution，但不应作为主要 selling point。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Hypothesis Test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 信号在 RL 后是否保留。\n      回应 Wang et al. (2025)。\n    expected_results:\n      # Pre-RL (SFT contaminated at 15%, from exp-ctrl-contam)\n      pre_rl_lz_star: 23.8\n      pre_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.78\n      pre_rl_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n      # Post-RL\n      post_rl_lz_star: 21.1\n      post_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.80\n      post_rl_delta_lz_star: 2.6\n      post_rl_signal_retention: 0.49\n      post_rl_still_detectable: \"marginal (p=0.08)\"\n      # Post-RL on clean model (control)\n      clean_post_rl_lz_star: 19.2\n      clean_post_rl_accuracy: 0.74\n      clean_post_rl_delta_from_clean_pre_rl: 0.7\n      # Signal attenuation\n      signal_attenuation_pct: 51\n      rl_smoothing_effect: \"GRPO redistributes probability mass, partially smoothing aberrant item-level patterns\"\n      detection_auroc_post_rl_15pct: 0.65\n      detection_auroc_pre_rl_15pct: 0.79\n    result_rationale: >\n      Wang et al. (2025) 证明 RL (PPO/DPO) 后 MIA-based 方法（Min-K%++ 等）检测力\n      大幅下降——因为 RL 重新分配了 token-level 概率分布，抹去了 memorization 的 \n      token-level 签名。\n      \n      IRT-FIT 操作在 binary response level，理论上对 token-level 变化更 robust——\n      只要模型仍然在不该答对的题目上答对，lz* 就会偏离。但 GRPO 也会部分\n      平滑 item-level patterns：(1) RL reward 通常基于 overall task performance \n      而非单 item accuracy，鼓励模型\"均匀化\"知识分布；(2) policy gradient 更新\n      可能让模型遗忘一些 SFT 过拟合的特定 items。\n      \n      Median 档预测：信号衰减约 50%（5.3 → 2.6 Δlz*），marginal detection (p=0.08)。\n      不像 MIA 方法完全失败，但也不能声称\"robust to RL\"。\n      这符合\"medium effect, conditional detection\"的整体 narrative。\n      AUROC 从 0.79 降到 0.65——仍然 above chance 但不再 reliable。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n        columns: [condition, accuracy, lz_star, delta_lz_star_from_clean, detection_p, auroc]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean (pre-RL)\", 0.71, 18.5, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Clean (post-RL)\", 0.74, 19.2, 0.7, 0.42, 0.53]\n          - [\"Contaminated 15% (pre-RL)\", 0.78, 23.8, 5.3, 0.028, 0.79]\n          - [\"Contaminated 15% (post-RL)\", 0.80, 21.1, 2.6, 0.08, 0.65]\n        note: \"GRPO training: 3 epochs, reward = accuracy on held-out reasoning tasks. Signal retention = post-RL delta / pre-RL delta = 49%.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Signal attenuation trajectory — lz* over RL training steps (0, 500, 1000, 2000, 5000 steps) for contaminated (red) and clean (blue) models. Gap narrows progressively. Annotated with AUROC at each checkpoint.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 信号衰减 ~50% 是一个 nuanced result：优于 MIA 方法的\"完全失败\"\n      但不能声称 robust。论文应这样 frame：\"IRT-FIT 的 binary-level 操作比 token-level \n      方法更 resilient to RL smoothing，但 post-RL detection 仍然是一个 open challenge。\"\n      Priority P2 合理——这是一个重要的 discussion point 但不是核心贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Extended Benchmarks — BBH and MATH\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      添加 BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n    expected_results:\n      # BBH (6511 items)\n      bbh_4pl_params_available: \"partial — PSN-IRT may have BBH but needs verification\"\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n      bbh_sim_power_5pct: 0.18\n      bbh_inverted_u_r2: 0.82\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.71\n      # MATH (5000 items)\n      math_4pl_params_available: \"likely not in PSN-IRT; may need calibration\"\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.65\n      math_sim_power_5pct: 0.14\n      math_inverted_u_r2: 0.79\n      math_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.67\n      # Filling the power gap\n      power_curve_r2_with_bbh_math: 0.93\n      power_curve_r2_without: 0.88\n      n_items_threshold_confirmation: \"≥5K items needed for AUROC>0.65 at 15%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 恰好落在 GSM8K (1319) 和 HellaSwag (10042) \n      之间，填补了 power curve 中 1K-10K 区间的数据空白。\n      \n      BBH 预期 power 0.72——接近 HellaSwag (0.733) 因为 item 数接近，\n      但 BBH 的 item 结构不同（多步推理题），可能导致 4PL 拟合更差。\n      MATH 预期 power 0.65——处于 GSM8K 和 BBH 之间。\n      \n      这两个 benchmark 的加入主要价值是让 power vs n_items 曲线拟合更精确\n      （R² 从 0.88 提升到 0.93），加强了 \"n_items threshold\" 的理论论证。\n      但 4PL 参数可用性是风险点——如果 PSN-IRT 没有这些 benchmark 的参数，\n      需要自己校准，GPU 预算可能显著增加。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Curve Data Points (Complete)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, \"sim_power@15%\", \"ctrl_auroc@15%\", source]\n        rows:\n          - [HumanEval, 164, 0.243, 0.54, \"existing\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 1172, 0.129, 0.58, \"existing\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.578, 0.63, \"existing\"]\n          - [MATH, 5000, 0.65, 0.67, \"new\"]\n          - [BBH, 6511, 0.72, 0.71, \"new\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.733, 0.74, \"existing\"]\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.979, 0.79, \"existing\"]\n        note: \"ARC-C power anomalously low for its n_items — item parameter distribution (narrow difficulty range) reduces effective information.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power vs n_items curve with all 7 benchmarks. Log-x scale. Fitted theoretical curve (from exp-power-theory) with confidence band. BBH and MATH points fall within prediction interval, confirming the theoretical relationship.\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 加强了 power-n_items 关系的实证支撑，使\"≥5K items for reliable detection\"\n      的 claim 更可信。但如果 4PL 参数需要自行校准，优先级应保持 P2——\n      这是 nice-to-have 而非 essential。\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 Gemini-1.5 的污染是全面性还是集中性。\n    expected_results:\n      n_mmlu_subjects: 57\n      n_subjects_with_sufficient_items: 42\n      min_items_per_subject_threshold: 100\n      # Gemini-1.5 domain pattern\n      gemini15_n_subjects_flagged: 38\n      gemini15_flagged_rate: 0.90\n      gemini15_domain_lz_star_mean: 5.2\n      gemini15_domain_lz_star_sd: 2.8\n      gemini15_top_aberrant_domains: [\"abstract_algebra (lz*=9.1)\", \"college_mathematics (lz*=8.7)\", \"formal_logic (lz*=8.3)\"]\n      gemini15_least_aberrant_domains: [\"high_school_us_history (lz*=1.2)\", \"world_religions (lz*=1.5)\"]\n      gemini15_stem_vs_humanities_lz_star_diff: 2.1\n      gemini15_contamination_pattern: \"broad but STEM-concentrated\"\n      # Other models\n      other_models_domain_concentration_gini: 0.45\n      domain_specificity_varies_by_model: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gemini-1.5 在 MMLU 上 100% accuracy + lz*=34.75 + θ=0.78 表明大规模污染。\n      Domain-level 分析可以区分：(1) 均匀污染（所有 subject 同样 aberrant）vs \n      (2) 集中污染（某些 domain 远比其他更 aberrant）。\n      \n      预测 Gemini-1.5 是\"broad but STEM-concentrated\"——90% 的 subjects 被标记\n      表明污染覆盖面广，但 STEM domains（数学、逻辑）的 lz* 更高，\n      可能因为这些 domain 的 item difficulty 分布更极端（有更多真正 hard items），\n      污染导致的 aberrance 更显著。文科 domain 的 items 整体较易，\n      即使没有污染高能力模型也能做对大多数，aberrance 信号更弱。\n      \n      Gini 系数 0.45 表明中等集中度——不完全均匀但也非极端集中。\n      这与\"SFT 在完整 MMLU 上训练\"的假说一致——训练覆盖所有 subject，\n      但不同 subject 的检测灵敏度取决于 item difficulty 分布。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain Analysis (Top/Bottom 5)\"\n        columns: [domain, n_items, accuracy, lz_star, flagged]\n        rows:\n          - [abstract_algebra, 100, 1.00, 9.1, \"yes\"]\n          - [college_mathematics, 100, 1.00, 8.7, \"yes\"]\n          - [formal_logic, 126, 1.00, 8.3, \"yes\"]\n          - [college_physics, 102, 1.00, 7.9, \"yes\"]\n          - [electrical_engineering, 145, 1.00, 7.5, \"yes\"]\n          - [\"...\", \"...\", \"...\", \"...\", \"...\"]\n          - [world_religions, 171, 1.00, 1.5, \"no\"]\n          - [high_school_us_history, 204, 1.00, 1.2, \"no\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MMLU domain-level lz* heatmap for Gemini-1.5 — 57 subjects sorted by lz*. Color gradient from white (low aberrance) to dark red (high aberrance). STEM cluster visually prominent. Superimposed: mean item difficulty per subject (blue line) showing correlation with lz*.\"\n      - \"Fig: STEM vs Humanities lz* boxplots for Gemini-1.5, showing significant difference (p<0.01). Other models shown as gray background for comparison — most show no STEM/Humanities lz* difference.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 为 Gemini-1.5 case study 增加了 granularity——不仅是\"flagged\"，\n      而是\"STEM-concentrated broad contamination\"。这在论文中可以用 1-2 段讨论，\n      展示 IRT-FIT 的 diagnostic 能力不仅限于 binary flagging。\n      但因为只有 Gemini-1.5 有 100% accuracy（其他模型无此极端 pattern），\n      这个分析的 generalizability 有限。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a99541df-3912-4843-939d-dd0e144f8c57","total_cost_usd":0.6248855,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11788,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":21537,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11788,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":21537,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11788,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11788},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6750,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006855,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":21537,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11788,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6180305,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"e97c28f5-6796-43af-b487-72df983edbb0"}
